WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.830
Someone once said:

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:58.930
There is a fruit full of juicy 
fat and toasted brown leaves,

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:05.640
and when it falls to the ground, it 
causes drowsiness and sends up steam...

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:09.570
Dreamy Pork Cutletrees!

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:21.890
And sweet beans as soft as light snow are 
closely packed together inside pods...

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.890
Sweet Bean Jammed Pods!

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.660
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:32.900
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.300
For the sake of Terry, who refuses to eat,

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.440
Toriko takes to the air by 
helicopter to the Wu Jungle,

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:43.880
rife with dangerous carnivorous 
plants, in search of BB Corn,

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.580
an ingredient only found 
in the Gourmet World.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.320
Meanwhile, to make the 
Gourmet Summit a success,

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:53.350
Komatsu accepts a mission from the IGO

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:56.890
to prepare a dish that will 
please President Dohem.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:02.530
Komatsu decides to follow 
Toriko into the Wu Jungle,

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:06.230
said to contain the Woolstar Sauce Fruit, 
the base of that delicious sauce.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.770
Tina, on the trail of a 
scoop, accompanies Komatsu,

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:12.170
and the two take off after 
Toriko in an IGO chopper.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:20.710
The Talent of Battle! Show Me, 
Terry, King in the Making!

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.690
I can see it, Toriko-sama!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.390
So we're finally there, eh?

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:36.560
Even though we had to avoid the habitat 
of giant monster birds on the way

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:39.400
and refuel a total of 6 times, 
we're traveling at mach 3,

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.830
so for it to take 3 full days 
to get there, this place is <i>far</i>!

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.470
I believe you burned through more food

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.270
than the helicopter burned 
fuel, Toriko-sama...

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.670
Oh, shut up...

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:51.040
We're almost there, Terry!

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:57.350
BB Corn... Blue-blood corn, 
named after Gourmet Nobles...

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.450
I hope it suits your taste.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:06.390
Toriko-san should be arriving 
in the Wool Continent by now.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.830
We have to hurry, Komatsu-kun.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.130
Can't you take the number of 
G's down a couple notches?!

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:16.270
I didn't ask you to tag 
along, Gourmet TV hack!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.340
You do have permission to film, I hope?

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:23.010
A historical scoop is on the line, so my 
boss gave me the thumbs up right away!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:25.210
Not that permission! IGO's!

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.940
I have freedom of the press!

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.850
You're on board my chopper without 
permission from the IGO?!

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:30.920
Permission! Permission!

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.320
You're a heaping helping of noise!

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:35.350
I wanna get the Woolstar 
Sauce Fruit as soon as I can,

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:35.350
I have freedom of the press and 
people have the right to know!

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:37.720
since I have to complete the 
sauce that goes with Bubbly Tuna

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.920
that'll make President Dohem's tongue hum.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.590
In charge of all the food

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.560
that will determine whether the 
Gourmet Summit is a success

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.400
is the Hotel Gourmet's head chef, um...

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.940
Komatsu-kun is doing his best.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.100
Please stand by!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.570
Exclusive scoop! We've 
got an exclusive scoop!

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.980
Information has just flown 
in that the head chef

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.680
has embarked on a trip to 
search for an ingredient!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:04.180
So, Komatsu-kun, you ignored 
my warning and went anyway.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.650
When will you tell me my fortune?!

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.090
I've been standing in line for 4 days!

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.860
I work for a big company and hence, 
I'm willing to pay a large amount.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:16.190
I'm from Gourfill Inc.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:18.300
Anyway, hurry up, look into the future

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:21.170
and tell me which ingredient is 
gonna be our next big moneymaker.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.840
I don't care who you are. You 
don't get to cut in line.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:27.110
If you have a problem with that, 
I won't mind if you leave.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:30.980
Right now, the Head Chef is heading 
for the dangerous Wu Jungle.

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.850
He's accompanied by a Gourmet 
TV reporter on assignment.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.810
The Wu Jungle!

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.750
How reckless can he be?!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.510
I'll bring you further 
updates as they come in.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.390
The main rotor,

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:44.760
which can obtain horsepower with 
beautiful aerodynamic efficiency.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.490
And this beautiful color...

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.700
No matter how many times I look at 
it, it seems fitting for me to ride.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.260
My personal helicopter.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:58.470
Used to convey me to a soothing 
country to mend my damaged cuticles.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.100
Listen to this!

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:02.970
What is it, Rin?!

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:04.410
Don't bother me!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:08.310
But Komatsu went to the Wu Jungle!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:11.280
The Wu Jungle?! That dangerous region?!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.990
Brother! I can't just stand 
around and do nothing!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.790
Rin! Your heart, that sympathizes 
with Matsu, is beautiful.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:24.900
Besides, Komatsu and Johannes like, 
went off in pursuit of Toriko!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.300
I wanted to go, too!

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.800
Oh, is that it?!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.500
The Wool Continent...

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
Wu Jungle

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
North Wool Continent

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
Toriko's House

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
No. 8 Biotope

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
World Kitchen

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
Cavern Lagoon

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.140
No. 1 Biotope

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:36.070
It's a gross area of 1,020,000,000 
square kilometers.

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:40.280
A continent boasting the third 
vastest area in the Human World...

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.220
And the Wu Jungle, located in that land,

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:49.190
also called Hell Plant, 
for its dangerous forest.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.960
Matsu went to the Wu Jungle...

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:58.830
Me, suddenly appearing to brilliantly 
save Matsu, who's hanging by a hair!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.370
I wanna see Toriko!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.300
Beautiful...

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.300
What's with those siblings?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:07.910
The Wu Jungle is 80 kilometers 
northwest of here!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:10.680
Since it's so dangerous, I can't 
get you any closer than this!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.880
This is fine! Thank you!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.710
I'll pray for your food fortune! {as opposed to "good fortune" ... get it?}

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:21.390
Let's go, Terry!

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.360
You're marking already?!

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:29.160
In a place with a fine view like this, 
there are no worries about getting lost!

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.260
Peaceful Flowers...

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:36.300
Peaceful Flower (Plant) Capture Level < 1

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.270
What's a flower that blooms on Peace Island,

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.440
the most peaceful place 
in the world, doing here?

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.970
When a menacing savage beast is near,

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.910
the number of petals it drops increases,

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.740
according to the strength of the creature.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.480
A convenient flower, this.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.910
I'll pick several of them to take with.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.760
Sure is hot...

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.930
I guess the jungle is 
still a little ways ahead.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.530
Look at this!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:10.130
A Sake Balloon Tree, the fruit of which 
looks like the red lanterns at a bar.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.940
This would be a good place to take a break.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:13.540
Terry!

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:17.680
Knife!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:28.750
Like the rumors say, it 
contains strong alcohol.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.760
Just right for me, though.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.390
I'm lucky!

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.030
String Cheeseweed!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.500
Perfect for a drinking snack!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.940
Terry! Want some?

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.850
So that's the Wu Jungle, huh?

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.220
BB Corn... I've never had it myself.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.190
I wonder how it tastes...

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.960
What's wrong, Terry?!

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:09.960
What is that?!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.400
A peach?!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.000
There's a peach tree with fruit like that?!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.330
Can you eat that, Terry?!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.670
Terry, get away from there!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.910
Peacheetah (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 6

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:33.920
A Peacheetah, which uses the 
scent of peaches to attract prey!

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:37.760
One dropped petal of the Peace Flower

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.490
indicates a Capture Level 
strength of 10 or more.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.960
It just dropped half a petal...

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:46.960
So this beast's Capture Level is 5.

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:49.170
No real threat.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:50.840
Don't bother, Terry.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.040
Let's keep moving on!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.600
Thank you!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:25.570
You brought me firewood?

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.910
Thank you.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:37.380
Terry Cloth is a Battle Wolf who 
carries the blood of ancient kings...

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:40.180
but Terry also has a side that's too kind.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:43.350
He may be worrying about me.

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.730
I want him to be himself more on this trip.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.270
All right!

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:05.640
We've arrived! This is the Wu Jungle!

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:07.710
Really dark...

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:11.620
Terry, before we go in, there's 
something I want to say.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.990
Right now, you and I are 
traveling companions,

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.450
but there's no helping each other.

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:19.890
In the wild here, put your own life first!

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:23.800
Jumping in to help haphazardly 
could put both our lives at risk,

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.200
so that's the one thing we have to avoid.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.600
Protect your own life.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:33.100
Don't fuss over me, but go 
forth under your own will.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.710
That's the deal! Understood, Terry?

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.810
That's the Wu Jungle!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:42.580
Isn't that...

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:43.920
Toriko-san?!

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:45.880
Toriko-san! Toriko-san!

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:48.250
Wait! Wait, Toriko!!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.620
Land this thing! Go down!

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:56.690
Landing near the jungle is 
dangerous with all the monsters,

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:57.800
but we don't have a choice!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.670
We lost sight of Toriko

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:07.840
and it's too dangerous for just 
us to enter the Wu Jungle.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:10.940
The best plan is to wait here 
for Toriko to come back.

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:14.080
But my scoop...

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:18.450
What beautiful flowers!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:20.420
Those are Peace Flowers.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.890
With them, we can protect 
ourselves from danger

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.220
while walking through the jungle.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.490
Really?!

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.690
Then I'll just take a few...

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:31.430
Komatsu-kun, it really is wiser to 
wait here until Toriko gets back.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:35.670
But the Bubbly Tuna will be 
good for only 3 more days.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:41.670
The return flight takes 2 days, so 
that just leaves me one day here.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.450
Something's in there...

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.160
Z-Zombie-san?

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.430
It's Zonge-sama, not Zombie!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.530
Z-Zonge-sama, y-y-y-your head...

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.640
What is this?

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:15.570
Gross! What the hell is this?!

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:16.770
It's sticky!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.540
What the hell is this thing?!

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.610
Go back to the jungle!

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:29.120
Must've latched onto me 
from a tree or weed...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.790
What was it, a Zonge-sama groupie?!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.190
I think it was just stuck on you...

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:37.960
I'm surprised you lived through that...

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.530
Don't tell me he really is a zombie...

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.740
I'm Zonge-sama, I tell you, not Zombie!

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:44.800
Remember it!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:50.940
But that reminds me, there really are 
meat-eating zombie-like plants in there!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.590
This certainly is "Hell Plant"...

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:04.190
Full of deadly plants...

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.660
Although a forest controlled 
by plants is mind-blowing...

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.830
These carnivorous plants 
even eat fierce beasts.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.530
Seeds and spores must have 
been carried on the wind

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:15.870
from the Gourmet World to the Human World.

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.340
Birds?

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.240
What's wrong, Terry?

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.350
What?!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.550
A plant seed in the bird crap?!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.120
Has it taken root in my shoulder?!

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:37.120
What vitality!

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:40.930
Knife!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.460
Be careful, Terry!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.770
Don't let yourself be hit 
by this rain of bird crap!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.180
Terry!

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.280
What the hell are you doing?!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.300
What the hell is that?!

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:27.970
Zombie Wood (Plant Beast) Capture Level 33

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.580
A walking plant?!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:39.120
No... It sets down roots at an amazing speed.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:45.120
The way the whole thing moves gives 
the illusion that it's a walking tree.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:49.590
Terry!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.130
Why did you help me?!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:54.830
I noticed that it was closing 
in on me from behind!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.130
Do you understand?

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:59.170
You may have been trying to help me...

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.870
but you just got in my way!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.090
Terry, we had an agreement 
not to help each other.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:20.060
In the first place, this 
trip is to get food for you.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.530
Try to fight this thing with your own power.

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:36.340
He's strong...

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:42.080
Terry, the way you are 
now, how far can you go?

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.960
That must be the plant's former meals...  {took out the unnecessary "looking closely"}

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.260
Just chewing through the 
trunk doesn't do any damage.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:03.470
Just the opposite, it's grown 
multiple new roots from there...

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:04.770
Terry!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:06.440
You're fighting a strong opponent.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.140
Think carefully!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:14.750
As Terry's the current 
owner of the Obasaurus,

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:18.580
it means he displayed more 
power than me at least.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:23.120
The Obasaurus must've sensed 
Terry's latent potential.

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:26.290
He has plenty of combat capability.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:31.400
Now all you need to do is unleash 
your power to the full, Terry!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.270
Fast!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.640
Terry's weapon is this speed!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.220
Be careful, Terry!

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:15.570
For just one instant, he gave me a glimpse!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.780
A glimpse of his talent!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:27.320
Oh, no!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.600
You did well.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:39.760
I'm proud of you.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.110
Is that your roar of victory?

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.320
Certainly, the fight is finished...

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.190
but you've lost.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.710
Are you okay, Terry?

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.680
It was a good battle.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.580
You won.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.900
Terry was running around at high speed

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.460
to rip open the surrounding 
Sake Balloon fruit,

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.570
which bathed the plant in alcohol.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.970
Then, with all his might, 
he gnashed his fangs,

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:55.010
creating sparks thats started a fire!

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:12.990
You're treating that thing's 
death with respect...

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:15.790
Terry, you...

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:22.230
Never mind, Terry.

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:23.740
You don't have to eat it.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.100
In the first place, it's not really dead.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.970
Bacteria will break up the burning 
ashes and by absorbing that nutrition,

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:32.410
the plant will soon 
regenerate, like a zombie.

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:38.950
That aside, what bothers me 
is the end of its long roots.

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:44.320
With the huge amount of food it absorbs,

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.930
what kind of fruit is borne 
at the tips of its roots?

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:20.120
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:26.400
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:33.600
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:38.580
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:43.680
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:47.020
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:51.520
on a journey with no end!

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:56.490
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:21:56.490 --> 00:21:59.600
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:05.640
amid the waves of time.

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:10.780
Gourmet News!

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.850
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:17.820
The food I'd like to introduce to you 
today is the fruit of the Sake Balloon.

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:20.790
Well, I'll take a sip as a taste test.

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:22.650
All part of the job.

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:29.530
I can taste the natural herbs and spices...

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:33.670
It's clear...

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:36.470
Mellow...

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:39.040
It tastes...

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:45.380
Caution: Children must not drink alcohol!

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:43.980
Has an adult taste...

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:50.720
Come on, Tina! Wake up!

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:52.220
Wake up!

00:22:56.850 --> 00:22:59.060
Hey, Tina! Tina-kun!

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:00.960
Tina-san! Wake up!

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:04.600
An' now, on to the nex' story...

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:09.040
The only thing that can turn BB Corn into popcorn

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:11.230
is the burning magma of a Wool volcano!

00:23:11.230 --> 00:23:13.040
Make sure not to burn it, Toriko!

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:16.740
For Terry’s Sake! Burst By Broiling Heat, BB Corn!

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:18.880
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
